4. PATENT NOTICE
----------------
The architecture implemented in this repository is the subject of:

  - Turkish national patent application TR 2025/012696
    (priority date: 4 September 2025)
  - International patent application PCT/IB2026/053070
    (filed 27 March 2026, designating 153 PCT contracting states)

The official TÜRKPATENT search report for the priority application
cited no document in category X (a document that alone prejudices
novelty); the claimed architecture was found novel over the searched
art, including US8450711B2 (Hewlett-Packard) and US11144718B2 (IBM).
International search and examination under the PCT are ongoing.

The patent claims are drafted independently of implementation
language, circuit topology, and process node.


